@url=http://localhost:3000


### Obtener vehiculos
GET {{url}}/vehiculos


### Consultar por un vehiculo
GET {{url}}/vehiculos/3


### Kilometros de un vehiculo

GET {{url}}/vehiculos/5/kilometros



### Crear vehiculo
POST {{url}}/vehiculos
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "marca": "Ford",
    "modelo": "Focus",
    "patente": "AA200HF",
    "anio": 2016,
    "capacidad_carga": 900
}

### Actualizar vehiculo

PUT {{url}}/vehiculos/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "marca": "Ford",
    "modelo": "Ranger XLS",
    "patente": "AB123CD",
    "anio": 2023,
    "capacidad_carga": 1300
}

### Eliminar vehiculo
DELETE {{url}}/vehiculos/3
